    "body": "Unblocked. The features this guide documents are now on main:\n- #1945 provider HTTP clients, OS keychain keys and offline-only mode (PR #2122),\n- #1946 the in-app AI chat dock panel,\n- #1942 batch undo, `get_selection` and the confirmation step.\n\nStill open, and out of scope for this pass: #1944 (context budgets and compact MCP read modes) and #1947 (single-source agent skills). The guide documents what has shipped and names those two as coming. Each setup step is checked against the code on main, not against the plans in #1773.\n",
